oset-antichain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b98049bc73009c64\" href=\"?note=b98049bc73009c64\" title=\"58-df-antichain\">58-df-antichain</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeAntichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeAntichain}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}tree\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeAntichain}_S(T,R,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,T,R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb5\\text{-}tree\\text{-}antichain} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb5TreeAntichain}_S(T,R,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Antichain}_S(A,T,R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The atom now reuses the canonical tree and antichain predicates instead of silently replacing the latter with an ad hoc incomparability clause.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-antichain","status":"resolved","id":"b98049bc73009c64","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-antichain]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","stat